tutorial-tide-him-find-the-pipe-5 = Look at the floor.
tutorial-tide-him-find-the-pipe-6 = See that? Disposal pipe, goes straight in there.

tutorial-tide-sg-open-construction = Open the construction menu.
tutorial-tide-control-open-construction = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="OpenCraftingMenu"][/bold][/color] to open the construction menu.
tutorial-tide-him-open-construction-1 = Somebody started work on it, knocked off for the shift, and never came back.
tutorial-tide-him-open-construction-2 = Two pieces missing. That's it. Just two.
tutorial-tide-him-open-construction-3 = Somebody's been meaning to finish that for six months. Today it's going to be you.
