tutorial-tide-control-flush = Right-click the disposal unit and pick Flush.
tutorial-tide-him-flush-1 = Now send yourself.
tutorial-tide-him-flush-2 = I'll wait here. Somebody's gotta watch the corridor.
tutorial-tide-him-flush-3 = See you on the other side.

tutorial-tide-sg-ride-pipe = Wait for the flush.
tutorial-tide-him-ride-pipe-1 = Now sit tight.

tutorial-tide-sg-take-hat = Take the captain's hat.
tutorial-tide-him-take-hat-1 = You alive in there?
tutorial-tide-him-take-hat-2 = Right. It's on the table. Pick it up.

tutorial-tide-sg-wear-hat = Put the hat on.
tutorial-tide-control-wear-hat = Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInHand"][/bold][/color] to put on the Captain's hat.
tutorial-tide-him-wear-hat-1 = Now put it on. Go on. Put it on.

tutorial-tide-sg-come-back = Come back.
tutorial-tide-control-come-back = Get into the disposal unit and flush yourself again.
tutorial-tide-him-come-back-1 = You almost look like a real Captain.
tutorial-tide-him-come-back-2 = Right, come back the same way.
tutorial-tide-him-come-back-3 = There's a bin on that side too. Same handle.
tutorial-tide-him-come-back-4 = I'll be here.
tutorial-tide-him-come-back-5 = There you are. Nice hat.

